    "segments": [
      { "index": 1, "text": "夜深之后，城市褪去了白日的喧嚣，", "duration_sec": 4.005488, "clip_duration_sec": 4.16 },
      { "index": 2, "text": "穿行在空旷的街道上，", "duration_sec": 2.5078, "clip_duration_sec": 2.68 },
      { "index": 3, "text": "抬眼望去，街角的面馆亮着一盏暖融融的灯。", "duration_sec": 4.307324, "clip_duration_sec": 4.68 },
      { "index": 4, "text": "放眼望去，小店不大，却在冷清的夜色里显得格外温馨，", "duration_sec": 5.329478, "clip_duration_sec": 5.48 },
      { "index": 5, "text": "成了晚归之人的一处避风港。", "duration_sec": 3.925488, "clip_duration_sec": 4.28 },
      { "index": 6, "text": "细看，大锅里的骨汤咕嘟咕嘟持续翻滚，", "duration_sec": 3.925488, "clip_duration_sec": 4.08 },
      { "index": 7, "text": "手工面条下入锅中，在沸水里轻轻起伏。", "duration_sec": 4.725283, "clip_duration_sec": 5.08 },
      { "index": 8, "text": "一碗碗热气腾腾的面食被端上桌，", "duration_sec": 4.214444, "clip_duration_sec": 4.4 },
      { "index": 9, "text": "升腾的白雾裹着鲜香，", "duration_sec": 5.503175, "clip_duration_sec": 5.68 },
      { "index": 10, "text": "瞬间驱散了深夜的寒意。", "duration_sec": 3.018639, "clip_duration_sec": 3.4 },
      { "index": 11, "text": "加班至深夜的打工人、", "duration_sec": 4.307324, "clip_duration_sec": 4.48 },
      { "index": 12, "text": "独自在外打拼的异乡人安静坐在桌前，", "duration_sec": 2.600658, "clip_duration_sec": 2.76 },
      { "index": 13, "text": "低头嗦面、小口喝汤。", "duration_sec": 3.703605, "clip_duration_sec": 4.08 },
      { "index": 14, "text": "一口热食下肚，一路奔波的疲惫、", "duration_sec": 5.630862, "clip_duration_sec": 5.8 },
      { "index": 15, "text": "独处异乡的孤单，都在这一碗面的温度里慢慢消散。", "duration_sec": 5.630862, "clip_duration_sec": 5.64 }
    ]
  },
